'''Pocket Espresso Machine''' is a {{Common}} [[Accessory]]. It increases {{Stat|Int}} at a {{Stat|Soulflow}} cost.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Pocket Espresso Machine''' is a {{O|rng|no=y}} drop from {{MobSprite|Voidgloom Seraph;{{Stier|4}} Voidgloom Seraph}} if the player has {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 4}} or higher. It has a {{Chance|0.39%|1|256.16|exact=55 in 14089}} chance to drop.

== Usage ==
'''Pocket Espresso Machine''' requires {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 4}} to use. 

{{ItemInfo
|name = Pocket Espresso Machine
|type = Accessory
|rarity = Common
|special_effect = Costs {{Stat|Soulflow|1}} per 5s in combat:
* Gain {{Stat|Intelligence|100}}
}}

Its ability can be toggled on and off by right clicking with it.

When in combat with it enabled and sufficient {{Stat|Soulflow}}, it gives the player {{Stat|Int|+100}} and takes away {{Stat|Soulflow|1}} every 5 seconds.

=== Salvaging ===
'''Pocket Espresso Machine''' can be salvaged for {{Item|Dragon Essence|amount=15}}.

== Trivia ==
*Due to its rarity and price, it is commonly referred to as Depresso within the playerbase.
